<body><main class="lab">
<header class="masthead"><div><p class="eyebrow">BIOL3216 <span>HUMAN PHYSIOLOGY IN EXTREME ENVIRONMENTS</span></p><h1>Human heat balance <span class="edition">Immersive lab</span></h1></div><div class="equation"><strong>S = M ± C ± R − E</strong><span>C includes convection + conduction</span></div><button id="open-notes" class="outline" type="button">Inside the model ↗</button></header>
<section class="preset-section" aria-label="Environmental presets"><div class="section-label"><span>START WITH A SCENE</span><span>Presets set the same four inputs</span></div><div id="presets" class="presets"></div></section>
<div class="workspace">
<section class="controls panel" aria-labelledby="conditions-title"><div class="panel-heading"><h2 id="conditions-title">Conditions</h2><span id="preset-name">Indoor</span></div><p class="control-intro">Predict first. Change one input.</p>
<div class="control"><label for="temperature">Air temperature <output id="temperature-value" for="temperature">22°C</output></label><input id="temperature" type="range" min="5" max="45" step="1" value="22"><div class="range-ends"><span>5°C</span><span>45°C</span></div></div>
<div class="control"><label for="humidity">Relative humidity <output id="humidity-value" for="humidity">40%</output></label><input id="humidity" type="range" min="10" max="100" step="1" value="40"><div class="range-ends"><span>10%</span><span>100%</span></div></div>
<div class="control"><label for="wind">Air movement <output id="wind-value" for="wind">0.1 m/s</output></label><input id="wind" type="range" min="0" max="4" step="0.1" value="0.1"><div class="range-ends"><span>Still · 0</span><span>4 m/s</span></div></div>
<div class="control activity-control"><label for="activity">Activity level</label><select id="activity"><option value="rest">Rest · 115 W</option><option value="light">Light · 230 W</option><option value="moderate">Moderate · 400 W</option><option value="heavy">Heavy · 600 W</option></select><p>Changes metabolic heat only.</p></div>
<div class="reference"><span>FIXED REFERENCE ADULT</span><p>Skin 33°C · 0.5 clo<br>70 kg · 1.8 m² surface area</p></div></section>
<section class="scene-panel" aria-label="Heat exchange with the environment"><div class="scene-heading"><span id="scene-name">Indoor environment</span><span>Whole-body heat rates · W</span></div><div class="scene" id="scene"><img id="scene-image"  width="1448" height="1086" alt="Reference adult in a shaded indoor environment.">
<svg class="flows" viewBox="0 0 1000 750" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="arrow-out" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="4" markerHeight="4" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" fill="#a9f1ff"/></marker><marker id="arrow-in" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="4" markerHeight="4" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" fill="#ffd083"/></marker></defs><path id="radiation-arrow" d="M413 270 Q345 180 252 190"/><path id="convection-arrow" d="M590 277 Q690 220 750 230"/><path id="evaporation-arrow" d="M403 410 Q330 440 255 476"/><path id="conduction-arrow" d="M550 668 L742 668"/></svg>
<div class="flow-label radiation" id="radiation-label"><span class="flow-name">Radiation <b>R</b></span><strong id="radiation-value"></strong><span class="direction" id="radiation-direction"></span></div>
<div class="flow-label convection" id="convection-label"><span class="flow-name">Convection <b>C</b></span><strong id="convection-value"></strong><span class="direction" id="convection-direction"></span></div>
<div class="flow-label evaporation" id="evaporation-label"><span class="flow-name">Evaporation <b>E</b></span><strong id="evaporation-value"></strong><span class="direction" id="evaporation-direction"></span><small>Actual, idealized loss</small></div>
<div class="flow-label conduction" id="conduction-label"><span class="flow-name">Conduction <b>K</b></span><strong id="conduction-value">0 W</strong><span class="direction" id="conduction-direction">Negligible contact</span></div>
<div class="metabolic"><span>METABOLIC HEAT · M</span><strong id="metabolic-value"></strong><small>Produced within the body</small></div>
</div><div class="scene-legend"><span><i class="loss-key"></i>Heat loss · outward</span><span><i class="gain-key"></i>Heat gain · inward</span><span>Arrows show direction, not scale</span></div><p class="scene-note">All scenes are shaded. Radiant temperature = air temperature. No solar load.</p></section>
<section class="balance panel" aria-labelledby="balance-title"><div class="panel-heading"><h2 id="balance-title">Can heat balance?</h2></div><p class="balance-intro">Compare what is required with what the environment permits.</p><div class="evap-metric"><div><label for="required-bar">Evaporation required <b>E<sub>req</sub></b></label><strong id="required-value"></strong></div><meter id="required-bar" min="0" max="1000" value="0">0</meter><p>Loss needed for zero heat storage.</p></div><div class="evap-metric capacity"><div><label for="maximum-bar">Evaporative capacity <b>E<sub>max</sub></b></label><strong id="maximum-value"></strong></div><meter id="maximum-bar" min="0" max="1000" value="0">0</meter><p>Maximum permitted by the environment.</p></div><p class="bar-note">Both bars use the same 0–1,000 W scale.</p><div class="storage" id="storage-card"><div><span>NET HEAT STORAGE · S</span><strong id="storage-value"></strong></div><h3 id="status"></h3><p id="status-detail"></p></div><p id="insight" class="insight"></p><p id="condensation-warning" class="warning" hidden>Condensation may add heat here. V1 omits that heat gain and sets evaporative capacity to zero.</p></section>
